Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.73,Chinese,C06-02-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}出发前，先看当前和满员人数，缺的是哪些兵团。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.73,English,C06-02-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Before departure, check current and maximum soldiers, and which regiments are understrength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:10.10,Chinese,C06-02-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}再读补给库存与军队容量、当地用量与补给上限。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:10.10,English,C06-02-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Then read supply stock and army capacity, followed by local usage and the supply limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:15.73,Chinese,C06-02-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}库存够不够、当地能不能支持当前用量，是不同的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:15.73,English,C06-02-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Having enough stock and being supported by the location are different questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:20.13,Chinese,C06-02-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}军队人数没变，地点条件也仍可能改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:20.13,English,C06-02-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Local conditions can change even when soldier numbers do not.
